Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav, intel-media-va-driver | mesa-va-drivers
Description: declarative screencast recorder for GNOME
 rec0 records tutorials and screencasts from a project file: a short YAML
 document describes the webcam, the windows to show and the output, and the
 scenes follow the window focus on their own while you work.
 .
 It composes everything live on a virtual desktop (webcam close-up, shared
 windows with a webcam bubble), keeps private pages out of the video, and
 optimizes the voice after recording (noise, levels, loudness for YouTube).
